<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Persetel details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Persetel details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Persetel Holdings Ltd said on Monday it would offer capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend for the period to November 30 on the following basis:</p>
<p>The ratio that 11.20 cents multiplied by 1.05 bears to the closing price of the stock on February 13 averaged with the closing price for the three prior trading days.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
